{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03（38秒）等较短段落中，连续出现的感受提示较密，观众可能来不及逐条接住；Y的左右分栏更便于一次扫到整体情绪。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把每段叙事的关键落点标出来，感受提示又能跟着音乐节点出现，既容易抓住人物当下的处境，也能感受到情绪如何变化。尤其从不愿再受委屈、舍不得被当作自己人的日子，到意识到孤独却不愿为陪伴回头，X把人物矛盾的来由和最终选择连接得更完整；音乐感受也有更多具体的声音、动作和身体反应。Y的分栏确实便于快速浏览，但不少感受词更像并列标签，而且S09把害怕孤独到可能重新忍受委屈的矛盾，收窄成难受时想有人陪，人物心理的复杂程度有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ce9fbe04-d7f3-44de-a080-90ca6010e317", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011543609637Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:17:09.816029+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "70dcaa804c1436160bcbf65c3b50592296f59b21504424ce58d7bedd0448048b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc